# Links {#sec:links}

A library the directory does not have: @{nolib:anything}.

A slug two books share: @{shared:same}.

A label the book does not have: @{pass:nicene#sec:nope}.

A range whose end comes before its start: @{pass:heidelberg#sec:q3..sec:q1}.

A locator on a book that interprets none: @{pass:nicene#14:8}.

A locator the book rejects: @{bible:romanos#99}.

A shelf path the book has moved from: @{reformed:old/heidelberg}.

A reference into a library that failed to load: @{broken:anything}.

A cross-reference to nothing: @sec:nowhere.
